Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sand hospitals and video.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\Nand reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, we share the music.\NCome on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the one dream. Come\Non, let's go, everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good time.\NCome on, let's go, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,baby, we share, Oh, we\Nshare the one world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me. Through\Nthe darkness that is in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see, but to believe,\NIn where we need to go, Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you and me, it's true that we, Feel\Nthe rush brought on by this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel\Nthe beat, Getting me to walk on,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,oh yeah, Share the music, no matter what,\NShare the one dream, believe in yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my\Nhand now, Share the one world now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:01:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars, And reach\Nfor the sky, No matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how\Nhigh. So let us go, beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,far and wide, I believe\Nin tomorrow if we try,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, Come on, let's\Ngo, everybody, Oh, we share the music,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music, Come on, let's go,\Nbaby, baby, Oh, we share the one world, Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.18,0:01:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,as we chase, we're being\Nchased, From the top we go,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One straight and wild. We're on\Nour way. I've got to say, Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.14,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to share your style, Now\Nhere it starts, so don't lose heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this\Nflavor. From boot to hood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so good, I will be free\Nto be, oh yeah, Share the music,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I, Share the one\Ndream, I know where you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the times, share the one world now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars, and reach\Nfor the sky, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high. So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,beyond, far and wide, I\Nbelieve in tomorrow if we try,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.02,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, I know that\Nyou are there, Just on the other side,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me, Soon it will be\Nyou and I, Then let us go, beyond,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,far and wide, I believe in\Nthe one world if we try,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go. Maybe, maybe.\NOh, we share the one world,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The flying fish just left?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And they were the ones\Nwho started the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed like they received a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was an order for them to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine why, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those flying fish are cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ride one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They can stay in the air\Nfor five minutes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's five minutes of awesome for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're headed to their base now, so\Nwe'll see them again soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We better be careful, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It might not be so easy next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we know they can\Nattack from the sea or the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how about lining\Nthe deck with cannons?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper Usopp will blow him out of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thinking, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Hatchan is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.08,0:03:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about yourself\Nwhile you're at it, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mackerel wants to catch you bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't drop your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Devil, the three\Nriders have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you ask us to call off the attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have captured the mermaids\Nand those pirates in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you a million times\NI want those pirates alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm on ripping limb from\Nlimb with my own two hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I start thinking about that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I got an itch on\Nmy back. I can't scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And I swear it gets worse every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, here comes the accent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day I've cursed that man's name!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day my hate for him grows!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Head, just calm down,\Nget a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that bastard's coming\Nstraight to my front door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This day's gonna be perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it kills me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand completely\NWe won't ruin it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you gotta\Nfollow my orders to the T.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm gonna murder this punk,\Nand ain't nobody gonna get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, head, whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, macro gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Davy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you say Davy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And you too, Totsweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you show a little\Nmore respect than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to learn some manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He said Davy, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You were saying, Master Devil, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, that masked guy talks funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you shut up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My most sincere apologies, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These two are dumb as bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ignore everything they say, and\NI promise they'll get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can run your stupid\Nfish mouths all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Far as I'm concerned, you're\Nmy angels of good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even begin to tell you how grateful\NI am for our little arrangement here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.89,0:05:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to shut up, Tamsui!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call it luck,\Nbut thanks to you three,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally meet the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can finally get my life back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, now who might they be exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't just my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The one I gotta kill if\Nit's the last thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on that boat. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel my hands around\Nhis neck as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Head, your accent, you gotta calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, he must really hate\Nthe crap out of that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd hear the name\NStraw Hat Pirates way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You, hey, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's Master Devil\Nshowing some damn respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying Kuma has been\Ncaptured by the Straw Hat Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad, really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the people she could run into, and\Nthey're all on their way here together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:06:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll arrive any time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But she didn't seem all\Nthat captured to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Looked more like she turned\Nto those pirates for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Far as I can tell, it looked like\Nthey were working together just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't matter who she brings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, they'll all be rounded up,\Ncaught, and sold to the human shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're here, they're history.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think those\NStraw Hats are crazy strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew. I'm in trouble. I\Nwonder if Nami's still
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,with them too I wonder\Nif she's still mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well duh of course she would be I did all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,those horrible things to\Nher when I was working
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,for Arlong if I don't hurry up and figure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,out some way to escape\Nbefore they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get my butt kicked just as much\Nas these other guys. I'm so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are here finally. The
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,time has come uh hey Macro yeah what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,do you want how about You let me go\Nand I give you some octopus fritters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can buy my own damn seafood what\Nkind of gun do You think I am did you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,see him is he on the ship yes Head\Nhe's there for sure all right then now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that everything\Nappears to be in order,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time for you\Nto get what's coming to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, I bet that's\Nthe Flying Fish Rider's base.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So Kami's friend Haki is being\Nheld somewhere around here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go in there and save him\Nbefore you know it, beautiful Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.64,0:08:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you're the best, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you go, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The macro gang have managed to\Ncapture me over 30 times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You get captured way too often.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You get eaten too often, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How would anyone want to set\Nup their base way out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For an enemy base, it's sure quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.16,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go straight ahead! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we at least go over\Nthe plan again or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hatchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mock! Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us Hachi back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's their flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's no use, I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That leaves me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi, agent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing things, or is\Nsomething in that cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.63,0:09:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it kind of looks like Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, we're in luck, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a single enemy in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they all decided that\Nthis is snack time or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You two cannot seriously be this stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The blindest man in the\Nworld could see that this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,is a trap they're totally\Nhiding out waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To investigate so they can ambush us what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,a brilliant deduction\Nthat's genius i never
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,would Have thought of that that's why you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,dumbasses keep getting\Ncaught you i'm here Kuma
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. There's no need\Nto worry. Okay. Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,they didn't do that it's\Nmy own fault actually
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,anyway this is A trap\Nget out of here before
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,they catch you don't worry i can take care
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,of myself i'll be Okay so just go there's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,something about that\Nguy's voice that seems
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,really familiar you\Nnoticed it too Right uh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-huh his shape too yeah\Ni know who he is you do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,let's just ask him and get this over with
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Already hey you so\Nhow's arlong doing these
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:11:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,days huh oh not so good actually him chew
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Caribou and all the others\Ngot caught by the navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the only one who escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've given up my life of crime and\NI'm running an octopus fritter shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny how time flies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The dumb squid with the swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.78,0:11:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They treat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You are one of Arlong's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the octopus fritter guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of crap is that? Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a really long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami's hometown of Cocoyashi\NVillage used to be under the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,control of a nasty bunch of\Nfishmen called the Arlong Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami herself was in an even worse\Nsituation having to work for those jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And this octopus guy, Hachi, was\None of Arlong's top henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's an old enemy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But Luffy and I, mainly me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,came along and beat the crap out\Nof every last one of those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:11:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After we left the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought their whole crew was\Ngoing to get arrested by the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like this guy\Nleft them behind and escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like quite the ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you dumb jerk fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we know it's you, there's\Nno way we're going to save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,so you better get used to that cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But, well, um, just asking,\Nbut are your octopus friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As yummy as everyone\Nsays they are, why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you think with your head\Ninstead of your stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a moron hey wait\Na second does this mean
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that you guys know hot\Nchin he must be like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,an Old friend of yours or something he's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,not our friend at all\Nno turn the ship around
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we can't help you\Ni know we said yes at
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,first but we didn't\Nknow this was the friend
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:13:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You were talking about.\NOh, come on, you can't just
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,leave him like this\Nafter coming all this way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't worry about\Nit Kuma just leave okay
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a trap this sucks\Nfine then i'll have to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,in i never
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,would have thought you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.13,0:13:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,would turn out to be such\Na bunch of heartless?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Morons! Morons! Morons! Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang on, Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, we won't\Nleave this place without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We got you now, Amy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're all gonna be filthy rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially since the only\Nguy who ever saves you, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna escape\Nfrom us this time, Amy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.92,0:13:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you just run away? Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:13:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Papagoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma hasn't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, hold on a second, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We might as well save him after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji isn't all that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd go so far as to say he's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna hold a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, we promised Kuma\Nwe'd help her, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I love when you're firm, but I\Nlove when you're forgiving, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save the octopus. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyes are octopus fritters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the preparations in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying fish riders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.68,0:15:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we're always ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for Gump! Gump!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pistons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got Devil Fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that little bump!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved us! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I got him, octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my most sincere\Ngratitude for saving little Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you one. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut up the octopus's\Ncage and untie him, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The trap is still set.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flying Fish Riders\Nhave got you surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll take you down any way they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.42,0:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if they\Ncome from the sea or sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna beat the crap out of them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it quick while we\Nstill have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go get Kuma back. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, Pupaku, it's dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, get a fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, get him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, they're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get it, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh fish delivery!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, which one do I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, fishy-fishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, nice ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! What if he falls?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.52,0:17:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Try some of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.84,0:17:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna sink the ship at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Monks, if they hit a lady with one of\Nthose bombs, then there'll be hell to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Love his tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll get in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:17:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're having a damn fight here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw around!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And you two were even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you\Nthink was going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You have Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have caused you\Nso much trouble, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,how about when we're in the\Nmiddle of a big dangerous fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't try to drown\Nyourselves in the ocean, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I should have let you guys sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Metro Gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her while the Straw Hats are busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, stop drowning and get\Nover here to help us already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going\Nto be in there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we got some bad blood between\Nus, but you're a great guy, Roronoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just following orders, so... Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You butcher cowards, you used me like\Na punching bag while I was tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm\Ngonna let that slide?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You want another taste of\Nmy fish bag karate? Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me.\NWant some? Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit, it was fun beating on you when\Nyou were tied up and couldn't fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I ain't picky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat on you any way you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you got any requests,\Ndirect them to my fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword and my ancient goldfish\Nfighting style will rip you to pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and the sea will run red with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.66,0:19:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll let you go this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Punch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jamie! Papagoom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I got\Ncaptured by those idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to put you in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.41,0:20:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all safe now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.10,0:20:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget about us already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want your buddy back,\Nyou'll have to go through us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But good luck with that, because\Nyou're in our territory, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You let your guard down too easily. Stay\Nback and leave this to us. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be done here in no time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I owe you again, Roronoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for what I did to you before
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when we fought I hurt you\Npretty bad with my six sword style
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think\Nyou hit me even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.48,0:21:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Chopper, line it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.22,0:21:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how they like this. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.78,0:21:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.74,0:21:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Three in one shot! Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Any of you men got the\Nballs to do a zero fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A zero fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting, but I don't know\Nif I'm up for the broken bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're going\Nto pay the medical bills?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How does a million berries sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it, head!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Step back, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.56,0:21:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.98,0:21:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Some big guy's coming right at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.18,0:21:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a huge club!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and looks like he's not steering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me the lunatic's trying\Nto crash straight into our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.86,0:21:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With that size and speed,\Nhe'll end up sinking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you get the fish, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:22:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no. Bear, get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can stop\Nme, go ahead and try.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm slamming into you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.27,0:22:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not turning away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, he's fast, but if he flies into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gump gump below.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what we're having for\Ndinner. Oh, wow! It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure could have caused a lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, these pirates are\Nputting up one hell of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ufa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There sure are a lot of those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of them do you think we have\Nto beat before they just give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.71,0:22:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ride! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I'm gonna stop trying\Nbecause of what happened last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.14,0:22:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.36,0:23:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not swimming after you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.56,0:23:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.22,0:23:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.34,0:23:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that in my first battle as a\Nmember of the crew, all I did was drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If I cannot right this wrong,\Nhow can I call myself a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many I can strike down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.62,0:23:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am of meager talent,\Nbut I shall do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back and observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.70,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the weird skeleton mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll run him straight through!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Music is power!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:23:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.24,0:24:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of move was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.44,0:24:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but whatever\Nit was, it was a dirty trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.90,0:24:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a trick at all, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.84,0:24:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was music!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.38,0:24:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here! Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.28,0:24:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.80,0:24:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta step things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.76,0:24:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.62,0:24:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll smash your head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.64,0:24:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.12,0:24:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, we're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.12,0:24:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That punk, he crashed\Nstraight into the heads room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.16,0:25:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.38,0:25:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.02,0:25:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A familiar face, huh?
